# Setup & install (AI allowed here)

When the user is installing or configuring (not in the send-like loop):

1. Follow [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md): environment first (macOS, **Xcode**, Python, WebDriverAgent, Accessibility, iPhone USB), then filters.
2. Ask **one topic at a time**. On **every** question include **"I'll edit from the code"** (exact English).
3. Do not invent personal preferences; write answers into `prefs.local.yaml` only.
4. Never require an API key for the bot to run after setup.

After setup, remind: daily use is `python3 hinge_wda.py` — no tokens needed.
